   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An important element of a democracy is to have well functioning state institutions for upholding the rule of law and the respect for human rights. Development of the Lithuanian penitentiary system is therefore of vital importance. The project consists of four  components: Twin prison programme, twin school programme and ad hoc assistance.</narrative>
